// - Q0067 (package D): an unset Deceleration reads as the converted Acceleration, so
//   "blue_spotter" (flying_saucer) brakes into its move destination (12, 32) at 0.010192 per tick
//   squared, where it stopped within one tick; from checkpoint 7 the checkpoints changed on that
